{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479080/extras/28606036c4cf2cdeeb9fd84d67947e3c.poster.avif?t=1774036072\" width=610 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479080/extras/28606036c4cf2cdeeb9fd84d67947e3c.webm?t=1774036072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dreampainters is a puzzle game that lets you visit the surreal world of the painter's dreams. Grab a brush, pick up some paint, and find your way through the craziest creations of a sleeping mind. Use your creativity, as each color allows you to interact with the environment in a unique way, letting you solve the puzzles in your own style. Customize your adventure even more by choosing which of the artist's memories influence each dream you experience through the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479080/extras/bc125b073602d0c2dd3d060931dc9de6.poster.avif?t=1774036072\" width=610 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479080/extras/bc125b073602d0c2dd3d060931dc9de6.webm?t=1774036072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Ray, a struggling artist looking for work, who stumbles upon a recruitment ad for a study on human creativity run by mysterious Neurem Labs. The pay is good, and all you have to do is sleep and let the scientists monitor your dreams\u2026 Sounds fantastic! But the deeper you fall asleep, the louder a little voice in your head gets \u2014 why is Neurem Labs so interested in your dreams? What do they do with them? And are you even who you think you are?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479080/extras/ecca6e19c0053bdbe5373b0f4204bbd4.poster.avif?t=1774036072\" width=610 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479080/extras/ecca6e19c0053bdbe5373b0f4204bbd4.webm?t=1774036072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paint the environment</strong> \u2014 use different colors to solve puzzles in diverse ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make a dream your own</strong> \u2014 choose which memory influences the environment of your dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player mode</strong> \u2014 immerse yourself in unique gameplay and unravel a story hidden in the painter's dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op mode</strong> \u2014 solve the puzzles designed for two players to enjoy.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3479080?t=1774036072","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479080/ff5a382d37962330a7e65cb486259134ca5663b6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774036072","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479080/c67b1a0b771dec31702608def6ed3e9f57dd0e78/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774036072","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479080/c67b1a0b771dec31702608def6ed3e9f57dd0e78/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774036072","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479080/extras/28606036c4cf2cdeeb9fd84d67947e3c.poster.avif?t=1774036072\" width=610 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479080/extras/28606036c4cf2cdeeb9fd84d67947e3c.webm?t=1774036072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dreampainters is a puzzle game that lets you visit the surreal world of the painter's dreams. Grab a brush, pick up some paint, and find your way through the craziest creations of a sleeping mind. Use your creativity, as each color allows you to interact with the environment in a unique way, letting you solve the puzzles in your own style. Customize your adventure even more by choosing which of the artist's memories influence each dream you experience through the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479080/extras/bc125b073602d0c2dd3d060931dc9de6.poster.avif?t=1774036072\" width=610 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479080/extras/bc125b073602d0c2dd3d060931dc9de6.webm?t=1774036072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Ray, a struggling artist looking for work, who stumbles upon a recruitment ad for a study on human creativity run by mysterious Neurem Labs. The pay is good, and all you have to do is sleep and let the scientists monitor your dreams\u2026 Sounds fantastic! But the deeper you fall asleep, the louder a little voice in your head gets \u2014 why is Neurem Labs so interested in your dreams? What do they do with them? And are you even who you think you are?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479080/extras/ecca6e19c0053bdbe5373b0f4204bbd4.poster.avif?t=1774036072\" width=610 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479080/extras/ecca6e19c0053bdbe5373b0f4204bbd4.webm?t=1774036072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paint the environment</strong> \u2014 use different colors to solve puzzles in diverse ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make a dream your own</strong> \u2014 choose which memory influences the environment of your dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player mode</strong> \u2014 immerse yourself in unique gameplay and unravel a story hidden in the painter's dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op mode</strong> \u2014 solve the puzzles designed for two players to enjoy.</p>","developers":["Stability Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479080/767a8dacaa6fb3c88b7f03b17ea803148070b04b/header.jpg?t=1774036072","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akama